DESCRIPTION >
    Precomputed all-time commit authorship per (channel, memberId, platform, username) over
    authored-commit and co-authored-commit activities. Bots, team members and organization
    profiles are excluded by the cleaned source (members_sorted). Rebuilt nightly by
    repo_commit_contributors_copy.pipe. Read in sorting-key order by the packages worker
    git-activity contributors sync (CM-1824), which maps `channel` to a packages-db repo and
    `username` to an email or GitHub login identity.

TAGS "Member contributors", "Repository URLs"

SCHEMA >
    `channel` String,
    `memberId` String,
    `platform` LowCardinality(String),
    `username` String,
    `commitCount` UInt64,
    `firstCommitAt` DateTime64(3),
    `lastCommitAt` DateTime64(3),
    `computedAt` DateTime

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY channel, memberId, platform, username
ENGINE_VER computedAt
